A better fusion target is the output norm plus final projection for `C=128`. I can keep tensor-core math by building `z` in registers and immediately doing a Triton `tl.dot` with `to_out.weight`, avoiding the intermediate `z` tensor and one cuBLAS launch. I’ll add that for `C == 128` only.
